# Example environment variables for local development
CHROMA_PERSIST_DIR=storage/chroma
EMBEDDING_MODEL=all-MiniLM-L6-v2
# Optional: Chroma Cloud settings
# CHROMA_CLOUD_API_KEY=your_chroma_cloud_api_key
# CHROMA_TENANT=your_tenant_id
# CHROMA_DATABASE=your_database_name

# --- Hugging Face -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Needed only for hosted inference (services/api /ask). Create a fine-grained token at
# https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens with "Make calls to Inference Providers"
# and nothing else -- it needs no write, no repo access.
#
# Put the real value in .env.local (gitignored), never here, and NEVER anywhere the game
# can read it: Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the public bundle, so a token in a
# VITE_ variable ships to every visitor of the Pages site. The token belongs to this
# service only. The browser talks to this service; this service talks to Hugging Face.
# HF_TOKEN=hf_...
# CANON_LLM=Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct
